    "title": "Sahabzada Yaqub Khan, 1920-2016",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "Sahabzada Yaqub Khan, Pakistan's former foreign minister and founding chair of the Aga Khan University's Board of Trustees, passed away at the age of 95.",
